@startuml
title Figure 72 — Legend for command-sequence flow charts

legend
|= Symbol |= Meaning |
| <img:rounded_rectangle> | Sequence entry/exit point |
| <img:rectangle> | MultiMediaCard BUS Command |
| <img:diamond_horizontal> | False exit of condition |
| <img:diamond_vertical> | True exit of condition |
| <img:dashed_rectangle> | Optional steps in sequence |
| <img:ellipse> | Host Activity |
| <img:parallel_box> | Parallel activities in the host (executed simultaneously) |
endlegend

note as N1
**Symbol Definitions:**

(  Return  ) : Sequence entry/exit point
[SEND_OP_COND] : MultiMediaCard BUS Command
<time-out?> --> : False exit of condition (horizontal arrow)
<card count = 0?> with down arrow : True exit of condition
[SEND_OP_COND] dashed : Optional steps in sequence
(Read data stream) ellipse : Host Activity
|SEND_STATUS|Read data stream| : Parallel activities (left and right sequences executed simultaneously)
end note

@enduml